[150.25, "o", "\r\nThe issue is that tests call `device.makeDefaultLibrary()` which searches the test bundle, not the Timbre module bundle. But `PipelineBootstrap.compileAll(device:cache:)` (without a library parameter) correctly tries `Bundle.module` from within the Timbre module. Let me update the test to not pass a library explicitly.\r\n"]
