[314.8, "o", "\u001b[2m  [294,977 ctx | 2 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[315.6, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Edit\u001b[0m \u001b[2mAudio/MicrophoneCapture.swift\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[315.75, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mRun MicrophoneCapture tests\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[315.9, "o", "  \u001b[2m  ... +2 more tool calls ...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[316.05, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mCommit RT thread ARC fix\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[316.2, "o", "\r\nLet me check the remaining HIGH items and do a quick triage of what's left:\r\n"]
[317.7, "o", "\u001b[2m  [296,245 ctx | 1 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[318.5, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mTriage remaining items\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[318.65, "o", "\r\nBH-001, BH-002, BH-100 are substantially addressed by the FullPipelineIntegrationTests. The remaining HIGH is **BH-104** \u2014 RenderCoordinator only has 3 tests. Let me tackle that, then move on to the MEDIUM items that strengthen pixel verification (BH-111, BH-112).\r\n"]
[320.15, "o", "\u001b[2m  [297,104 ctx | 1 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[320.95, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Read\u001b[0m \u001b[2mRendering/RenderCoordinatorTests.swift\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[321.1, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Edit\u001b[0m \u001b[2mRendering/RenderCoordinatorTests.swift\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[321.25, "o", "  \u001b[2m  ... +3 more tool calls ...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[321.4, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mCheck tail of test output\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[321.55, "o", "\r\nThe crash is from `testInflightSemaphoreAllowsThreeFrames` \u2014 it acquires 3 semaphore slots but only signals 1. The remaining 2 cause a crash on deallocation. Let me fix it:\r\n"]
[323.05, "o", "\u001b[2m  [301,191 ctx | 8 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[323.85, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Edit\u001b[0m \u001b[2mRendering/RenderCoordinatorTests.swift\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[324.0, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mRun coordinator tests\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[324.15, "o", "\r\nAll 6 coordinator tests pass. Let me commit and continue.\r\n"]
[325.65, "o", "\u001b[2m  [303,749 ctx | 1 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[326.45, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mCommit coordinator tests\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[326.6, "o", "\r\nNow let me tackle **BH-209** \u2014 Best-effort bootstrap with sub-minimum drawable size. The app should show an error if the framebuffer is too small:\r\n"]
[328.1, "o", "\u001b[2m  [304,142 ctx | 4 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[328.9, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Read\u001b[0m \u001b[2mTimbreApp/TimbreAppMain.swift\u001b[0m\r\n"]
